</div><div id="inner_content-2-11" class="ct-inner-content"><section id="section-2-48" class=" ct-section c-hero-xs"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h2 id="headline-3-48" class="ct-headline c-h1 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Function Venue in Glen Iris</h2></div></section><section id="section-8-48" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h1 id="headline-9-48" class="ct-headline c-h2 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Height of excellence on High St.&nbsp; Function venue with character for events, parties in Glen Iris</h1><div id="text_block-10-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-l c-margin-bottom-l c-text-light">QT’ Kitchen is an institution in the Glen Iris and Ashburton area, known for its family-like service and Australian inspired Vietnamese cuisine. We’re now opening our large venue to the local community to host functions, events or even a birthday party. <br><br>We are fully licensed and with a wine list to impress. In addition, we offer flexible food and beverage packages tailored to a cocktail birthday for 20 guests or a corporate seated function for 90 people.<b></b><br><br>Dietary requirements are our expertise.&nbsp; Gluten-Free, Dairy-Free, Vegan and Vegetarian varieties of dishes can be arranged.&nbsp; Our menu typically starts with small starters (Spring Rolls, Banh Mi, Won Tons) and can be built up from there.<br></div><div id="text_block-12-48" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-m c-text-l c-heading-dark"></div><img id="image-14-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/BMW04523-2.jpg" class="ct-image c-img-max"></div></section><section id="section-75-88" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark-alt"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-76-88" class="ct-div-block c-columns-2 c-columns-s-1 c-columns-gap-xl"><img id="image-77-88" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/BMW04543.jpg" class="ct-image c-rounded c-shadow"><div id="div_block-78-88" class="ct-div-block">